|lore=Able leader and captain of the Avenger. Was given his command by Admiral Ozzel. Treated with suspicion by Darth Vader and the Emperor, who distrust Ozzel's close advisors.
|game_text=Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. When piloting Avenger, that starship is also immune to attrition &lt; 4. You may re-target applicable Utinni Effects to Needa. While Needa in battle, your other non-hit characters here may not be forfeited.
|errata_history=The repository first records this PNG on 23 December 2022 at 05:55 UTC. Its GIF copy later that day has identical decoded pixels. The printed mark is “D-E1”; this is the fourth distinct PC image in the dated sequence. The final sentence reads “While Needa in battle, your other non-hit characters here may not be forfeited.” The [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/8690453b331b89dd6111d91f82829fbce8818cad/Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/hires/captainneeda.png December 2022 PNG] prints <code>non-hit characters</code>; the [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/68f360e2267b93314bec3b27e3797d5b355171d8/Images-HT/starwars/Dagobah-Dark/hires/captainneeda.png February 2023 PNG] adds quotation marks around <code>hit</code>. The game-text words are the same; the punctuation differs. '''What changed on the card image:''' [[File:Captain-Needa-PC-E1-2018-game-text.png|frameless|300px]] before → [[File:Captain-Needa-PC-E2-2022-game-text.png|frameless|300px]] after. Source: [[:File:Dagobah-D-Captain-Needa-PC-E2-2022-12-23.png|published face]]. <!-- pce-dark-mark-4 --> '''PC transcription error — printed errata mark:''' This is image 4 in the published PC chronology; the face prints <code>D-E1</code>. The article number follows image order, and the printed mark is preserved. Earlier partial source: [[Captain Needa (PC Errata 2)]], June 2017. Repository timestamps are first located records, not established first publication days.
